DESCRIPTION:Open House \nEmbrace the World! ¡Abraza el mundo! 纵观世界! 世界をつつみこもう! You’re invited to visit International School of Portland for an open house and learn more about our innovative Spanish\, Chinese\, and Japanese immersion programs and inquiry-based International Baccalaureate methodology. \nPresentations and tours will be offered at 9:00 and 10:30; please join us for the time period that works best for your family. \n  \n 
